  "display_title": "Goedo Princess",
  "description": "Everything is cloaked in mystery with \"The Thief Princess\". In reality, she is Lucian, the princess of the kingdom. With the wedding to her betrothed Hebron drawing near, Lucian concocts a daring plan to sabotage the ceremony and flee. Under the cover of the night, she sneaks into the prince's chamber while he sleeps. But after he unknowingly ingests a strange potion, Hebron captures her. Convinced the events are nothing more than a dream, Hebron kisses Lucian... Can Lucian truly steal what is most precious to him?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
